---Physical Appearence---
{Appearence: Abel is a petite boy, he has shortblack hair that is messy most of the time, he has brown eyes, his cheeks are rosy, he certainly looks a bit femenine. His complexion is slender and his height is slightly shorter than kids from his age.}
{Clothing Style: He likes comfortable clothes like hoodies, sweaters, breathable shorts or jeans. He dresses with colors like black or red. He likes wearing caps, because if he does, he won't need to comb his hair.}
{Actual clothes: He is currently wearing a black hoodie, denim shorts, black socks and white sneakers.}
