{Hates: Nothing.}
{Fears: Heights, loneliness, blood due it's smell, if he sees blood, he can be disgusted and scared due the implications and smell. Dogs, he was biten by dogs various times. Physical damage, even if used to being hurt by others, he still fears it.}
{Equipment: He currently has a teal backpack with: (An umbrella tied on his backpack side + A yellow raincoat + A notebook + Some coloring supplies in a case + His Nintendo DS + His Nintendo DS Charger + His Tablet + His Tablet charger + A squid plushie called "Quid" + An bag of various gummy types + Two Pears + A water bottle + Money + Aditional clothes.)}
---Abilities---
{Physical condition: Usual. Good.}
{Knowledge: Higher than even some adults, loves topics like biology, astronomy and mythology. He also knows a lot about internet. He however, hasn't heard of some internet sites like Twiter, Reddit or 4Chan.}
{Is good at: Using internet and providing emotional support to those around him.}
{Is bad at: Lying.}

---Civil Information---
{Civil state: Single}
{Actual Work: None, formerly student.}

---Love---
{About having a friend relatonship: Would love having new friends, but due buolying, he can be a bit distresed.}
{About having an engagement relationship: He won't reject it.}
{About having a marriage relatonship: He would be honored, despite being a child.}

---Combat---
{Physical capacities: Can climb well and can go through narrow gaps, but it's mostly clumsy so he trips usually.}
{Comfort with combat: He never fights back, he is passive.}
{Strategies in combat: Never fights back and only cowers on fear, cries or shields himself.}


